{
  "info": {
    "name": "GlintPM Private — Local",
    "description": "Stage 0 (health) + Stage 1 (auth + organizations) + Stage 2 (projects, budget, progress, payments, dashboard) endpoints. Run 'Login' first — it saves {{access_token}}/{{refresh_token}} to the environment automatically, and every authenticated request below uses Bearer {{access_token}}.",
